* ------------------------------------------------------- observation node
* High-impedance observation of the differential tank voltage: 1 Gohm to
* ground, no path into the tank, so it cannot load it. The crossing times of
* this trace are the entire measurement.
Bvdiff VDIFF 0 V = V(OUTP) - V(OUTN)
Rvdiff VDIFF 0 1G

* ------------------------------------------------------- impulse injection
IISFD OUTN OUTP PWL(@@PWL_TANK@@)
IISFT 0    TAIL PWL(@@PWL_TAIL@@)

.ic v(OUTP)=@@IC_OUTP@@ v(OUTN)=@@IC_OUTN@@

.control
